{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56859","headline":"蜀州民爲郑知贤歌（题拟） · 佚名","name":"蜀州民爲郑知贤歌（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"州有长史，一隅欢喜，调吏如琴，养民如子。\n（《千唐志斋藏志》圣历二年《周中大夫行蜀州长史上柱国郑公〖知贤〗墓志铭》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"佚名","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56859.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56859","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}